{{<layout}}{{$body}}
<h1>When you can come</h1>
{{#problem}}<p class="problem">{{.}}</p>{{/problem}}

<p class="hint">Two different things, and they work together. <strong>Your evenings</strong> are the
  shape of a normal week &mdash; the hours you would like to be free, week after week. <strong>Your
  calendar</strong> is where the exceptions come from, so the fortnight you are away stops being a
  fortnight the community plans around you. Nobody here ever sees what is in it: this server reads
  the times you are busy and keeps nothing else, not a title, not a place, not who you are with.</p>

<h2>A normal week</h2>
{{#assumed}}<p class="hint">You have not said, so this community is assuming weekday evenings from
  {{assumedEvening}} to {{assumedNight}} and most of a weekend day from {{assumedWeekend}}. That is
  a guess, and it is counted. Anything you put below replaces it entirely.</p>{{/assumed}}
{{#anyWindows}}
<div class="scroller"><table>
  <thead><tr><th>day</th><th>from</th><th>to</th><th>note</th><th></th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>{{#windows}}<tr>
    <td>{{day}}</td><td class="mono">{{from}}</td><td class="mono">{{to}}</td>
    <td class="dim">{{note}}</td>
    <td class="actions"><form class="inline" method="post" action="{{action}}">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{csrf}}">
      <input type="hidden" name="action" value="remove_window">
      <input type="hidden" name="window" value="{{id}}">
      <button type="submit" class="quiet">Remove</button>
    </form></td>
  </tr>{{/windows}}</tbody>
</table></div>
{{/anyWindows}}

<form method="post" action="{{action}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{csrf}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="action" value="add_window">
  <div class="row">
    <div><label for="a-day">day</label>
      <select id="a-day" name="day">{{#days}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/days}}</select></div>
    <div><label for="a-from">from</label><input id="a-from" type="time" name="from" value="19:00" required></div>
    <div><label for="a-to">to</label><input id="a-to" type="time" name="to" value="22:00" required></div>
  </div>
  <div><label for="a-note">anything worth knowing <span class="dim">&mdash; optional</span></label>
    <input id="a-note" type="text" name="note" maxlength="256" placeholder="not on match nights"></div>
  <div class="doing"><button type="submit">Add it</button></div>
</form>

<h2>Your calendars</h2>
{{#anyLinks}}
<div class="scroller"><table>
  <thead><tr><th>what</th><th>last read</th><th>busy blocks</th><th></th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>{{#links}}<tr>
    <td>{{label}}<div class="dim">{{host}}</div>{{#problem}}<div class="problem">{{.}}</div>{{/problem}}</td>
    <td class="dim">{{read}}</td>
    <td class="dim">{{blocks}}</td>
    <td class="actions"><form class="inline" method="post" action="{{action}}">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{csrf}}">
      <input type="hidden" name="action" value="remove_link">
      <input type="hidden" name="link" value="{{id}}">
      <button type="submit" class="quiet">Remove</button>
    </form></td>
  </tr>{{/links}}</tbody>
</table></div>
{{/anyLinks}}
<form method="post" action="{{action}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{csrf}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="action" value="add_link">
  <div><label for="a-url">the address of a calendar <span class="dim">&mdash; https:// or webcal://</span></label>
    <input id="a-url" type="text" name="url" maxlength="1024" placeholder="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/.../basic.ics" required></div>
  <div><label for="a-label">what to call it</label>
    <input id="a-label" type="text" name="label" maxlength="128" placeholder="work"></div>
  <div class="doing"><button type="submit">Add it</button></div>
</form>
<p class="hint">Up to {{maxLinks}}. Read once a day, at {{refreshHour}}, {{horizonDays}} days ahead.
  Where to find the address:</p>
<ul class="hint">{{#examples}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/examples}}</ul>

{{#planner}}
<h2>When everybody can come</h2>
{{#anyBest}}<p class="hint">Best of the week, from {{from}} to {{to}}:
  {{#best}}<strong>{{when}}</strong> &mdash; {{clear}} of {{ideal}}. {{/best}}</p>{{/anyBest}}
<p class="hint">{{people}} member(s): {{said}} said when they can come, {{assumedPeople}} are being
  assumed, {{linkedPeople}} have a calendar this server reads.
  {{^healthy}}<strong>Most of this grid is an assumption</strong> &mdash; useful, and worth less
  than what people actually say. A link to this page is the whole ask.{{/healthy}}</p>
{{^anyRows}}<p class="hint">Nobody is free at any hour, which almost certainly means nobody has
  been approved yet.</p>{{/anyRows}}
{{#anyRows}}
<div class="scroller"><table class="heat">
  <thead><tr><th></th>{{#headings}}<th>{{day}}</th>{{/headings}}</tr></thead>
  <tbody>{{#rows}}<tr>
    <th class="mono">{{hour}}</th>
    {{#cells}}<td class="heat{{heat}}" title="{{clear}} clear of {{ideal}} who would like it">{{#any}}{{clear}}{{#lost}}<span class="dim">/{{ideal}}</span>{{/lost}}{{/any}}</td>{{/cells}}
  </tr>{{/rows}}</tbody>
</table></div>
<p class="hint">Each cell is how many people are clear at that hour <em>every week</em> between now
  and {{to}} &mdash; not how many are free next Tuesday. The second number, when it differs, is how
  many would like that hour but have something in the way. Hours nobody has claimed are left out.</p>
<p class="hint">Counts, never names. Who is free on Thursday is a question about individuals that
  nobody here agreed to answer.</p>
{{/anyRows}}
{{/planner}}
{{/body}}{{/layout}}
